.idea/
node_modules/

# Compiled compendium packs — source of truth is packs/src/
packs/*/
!packs/src/

/.claude
scripts/release.ps1
# Local dev scratch scripts stay out of the repo — except the test-fixture generator,
# which is the body of the GM-only "(TEST ONLY) Populate World" macro and so has to
# travel with a checkout and a release (see .github/workflows/release.yml). The pattern
# has to be scripts/local/* rather than scripts/local/: git cannot re-include a file
# inside an excluded DIRECTORY, so a trailing-slash rule makes the negation below a no-op.
scripts/local/*
!scripts/local/create-test-characters.js
/free pdfs

# Build artifacts and dev scratch files
*.lnk
stonetop_pwd.zip
extracted_text.txt
sample-data.md
TODO.md
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Copyrighted / PDF-derived images — must never be committed (live in the private mirror repo).
#
# This list is DURABLE_ART_DIRS in module/book2-art/browse.js: every directory the Import Book
# Art flow writes extracted PDF art into. The two lists are kept honest by a test
# (tests/book2-art/art-not-tracked.test.js), because they drift silently otherwise: for most of
# this system's life only the first three were here, while the importer had grown to seven.
#
# Root-anchored with a trailing slash, deliberately. A bare `people/` or `steading/` matches at
# ANY depth and would swallow assets/icons/people, assets/icons/steading and friends, which are
# our own drawn icons and must stay tracked.
assets/maps/
assets/bestiary/
assets/locations/
assets/treasures/
assets/people/
assets/steading/
assets/diagrams/
